Today is Sunday morning.
It is raining heavily outside.
Today the rain is heavier than yesterday.
The green shirt I bought yesterday is small.
I need a shirt bigger than this.
Therefore, I am going to that clothing store again.
To go outside in the rain, I put on the new raincoat.
I liked this yellow raincoat very much.
I put on the raincoat and go on the bicycle.
Because it is Sunday, there are fewer vehicles on the road.
Therefore, it is a nice peaceful journey.
After a while, I arrive in front of the shop.
I park the bicycle there.
Then I go inside the shop with the shopping bag.
